# LIVE-RANGE-HISTORY — results

Pre-registration: `forge/LIVE_RANGE_HISTORY_PREREG.md`. Test = last 40% of dates per class (fx_gold from 2022-06-23, indices from 2022-07-12); 1079 test dates, 36340 instrument-sessions, 92,914 real line touches, 96,912 placebo touches.

## Q1 replay

Shipped-JS fidelity: 15 recent sessions × 3 instruments, 1,890 lines, max difference 0.0σ (`forge/live_range_fidelity.mjs`). Phantom lines (sit on the running extreme, offset 0, excluded): 1,129,689 of 4,551,726 drawn lines in the test period.

