## Q3 what happens after a touch

Race from the touch bar's close: next line out vs back level (resolved races only; pre-resolved and both-in-one-bar excluded). Baseline = placebo ladders (control lines at 0.7–0.9× / 1.1–1.3× the distances, same code, same sessions).

Of 92,914 real touches: 13,328 (14.3%) closed the touch bar already past the next line or back level; 489 both-in-one-bar; 1,612 unresolved by 22:00.

